{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "PoYo AI - xAI TTS 1 API",
    "description": "xAI TTS 1 API 将最多 15,000 个字符的文本转换为语音，可选五种音色之一，支持 BCP-47 语言代码或自动检测，以及行内表达标签。可选择编解码器、采样率和 MP3 比特率。",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.poyo.ai",
      "description": "生产环境"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "BearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/generate/submit": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "提交 xAI TTS 1 任务",
        "description": "将文本转换为富有表现力的语音音频。",
        "operationId": "submitXaiTts1Task",
        "tags": [
          "xAI TTS 1"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubmitRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "text-to-speech": {
                  "summary": "文本转语音",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "xai-tts-1",
                    "callback_url": "https://your-domain.com/callback",
                    "input": {
                      "text": "Welcome to the xAI text to speech demo. [pause] <whisper>This line is softer.</whisper> [laugh] Now back to a clear product narration voice.",
                      "voice": "eve",
                      "language_code": "auto",
                      "output_format": {
                        "codec": "mp3",
                        "sample_rate": 24000,
                        "bit_rate": 128000
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "telephony": {
                  "summary": "电话场景优化输出",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "xai-tts-1",
                    "callback_url": "https://your-domain.com/callback",
                    "input": {
                      "text": "Your verification code is ready. [pause] Please enter it within five minutes.",
                      "voice": "ara",
                      "language_code": "en",
                      "output_format": {
                        "codec": "mulaw",
                        "sample_rate": 8000
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务提交成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubmitResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数无效",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未授权",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "API Key",
        "description": "所有 API 接口都需要 Bearer Token 认证。\n\n创建 API Key：登录 PoYo，进入 **仪表盘 → API 密钥**（[poyo.ai/zh/dashboard/api-key](https://poyo.ai/zh/dashboard/api-key)），点击创建 Key。\n\n在请求头中添加：\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\n```"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "SubmitRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "input"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "模型标识符。",
            "enum": [
              "xai-tts-1"
            ],
            "example": "xai-tts-1"
          },
          "callback_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "接收结果通知的 Webhook 回调 URL",
            "example": "https://your-domain.com/callback"
          },
          "input": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "text"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "text": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "要转换为语音的文本。支持 [laugh]、[pause]、[sigh]、<whisper>text</whisper> 和 <slow>text</slow> 等表现力标签。",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 15000,
                "example": "Hello! [pause] <whisper>This is a softer line.</whisper>"
              },
              "voice": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "用于语音生成的预设音色。",
                "enum": [
                  "eve",
                  "ara",
                  "rex",
                  "sal",
                  "leo"
                ],
                "default": "eve",
                "example": "eve"
              },
              "language_code": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "BCP-47 语言代码，或 auto 表示自动检测。",
                "enum": [
                  "auto",
                  "en",
                  "ar-EG",
                  "ar-SA",
                  "ar-AE",
                  "bn",
                  "zh",
                  "fr",
                  "de",
                  "hi",
                  "id",
                  "it",
                  "ja",
                  "ko",
                  "pt-BR",
                  "pt-PT",
                  "ru",
                  "es-MX",
                  "es-ES",
                  "tr",
                  "vi"
                ],
                "default": "auto",
                "example": "auto"
              },
              "output_format": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OutputFormat"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "OutputFormat": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "音频输出格式配置。",
        "properties": {
          "codec": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "mp3",
              "wav",
              "pcm",
              "mulaw",
              "alaw"
            ],
            "default": "mp3",
            "example": "mp3"
          },
          "sample_rate": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              8000,
              16000,
              22050,
              24000,
              44100,
              48000
            ],
            "default": 24000,
            "example": 24000
          },
          "bit_rate": {
            "type": "integer",
            "nullable": true,
            "enum": [
              32000,
              64000,
              96000,
              128000,
              192000,
              null
            ],
            "description": "比特率（bps）。仅适用于 MP3 编解码器。",
            "default": 128000,
            "example": 128000
          }
        }
      },
      "SubmitResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "code",
          "data"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 200,
            "enum": [200, 400, 401, 402, 403, 404, 408, 429, 500, 502, 503],
            "description": "业务状态码。`200` 表示成功，其他值都表示请求失败。请务必检查这个字段：部分参数校验错误会以 HTTP 200 返回，响应体里的 `code` 为 `400`。\n\n- `200`：成功\n- `400`：请求参数无效\n- `401`：API Key 缺失或无效\n- `402`：积分不足\n- `403`：没有权限\n- `404`：资源不存在\n- `408`：请求超时\n- `429`：请求频率超限\n- `500`：服务器内部错误\n- `502`：上游服务错误\n- `503`：服务暂不可用\n\n详见[错误码](/zh/api-manual/error-codes)。"
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "task_id",
              "status",
              "created_time"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "task_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "task-unified-1757165031-uyujaw3d"
              },
              "status": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": ["not_started", "running", "finished", "failed"],
                "example": "not_started",
                "description": "任务状态。提交后立即返回时始终为 `not_started`。后续状态请通过[查询任务状态](/zh/api-manual/task-management/status)接口或 `callback_url` 获取。\n\n- `not_started`：排队中，等待处理\n- `running`：生成中\n- `finished`：已完成，结果在 `files` 或 `output` 中\n- `failed`：失败，详情见 `error_message`"
              },
              "created_time": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time",
                "example": "2026-06-25T10:30:00"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [200, 400, 401, 402, 403, 404, 408, 429, 500, 502, 503],
            "description": "业务状态码。`200` 表示成功，其他值都表示请求失败。请务必检查这个字段：部分参数校验错误会以 HTTP 200 返回，响应体里的 `code` 为 `400`。\n\n- `200`：成功\n- `400`：请求参数无效\n- `401`：API Key 缺失或无效\n- `402`：积分不足\n- `403`：没有权限\n- `404`：资源不存在\n- `408`：请求超时\n- `429`：请求频率超限\n- `500`：服务器内部错误\n- `502`：上游服务错误\n- `503`：服务暂不可用\n\n详见[错误码](/zh/api-manual/error-codes)。"
          },
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "message": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
